# Component Patterns

## File Organization

- **Every component must live in its own folder** — never place loose `.tsx` / `.module.scss` files directly inside a parent folder
- Each folder has an `index.ts` that exports everything from that folder
- For grouped components (e.g., `BoatDetails/`), each sub-component gets its own folder inside the group, and the group has a top-level `index.ts` that re-exports all sub-components

```
components/
  ComponentName/
    ComponentName.tsx            # Main component
    ComponentName.module.scss    # Styles
    ComponentName.stories.tsx    # Storybook stories
    ComponentNameConnector.tsx   # Server/data wrapper (optional)
    index.ts                     # export { ComponentName } from "./ComponentName"

  GroupName/                     # Grouped components (e.g., BoatDetails)
    SubComponent/
      SubComponent.tsx
      SubComponent.module.scss
      SubComponent.stories.tsx
      index.ts
    AnotherComponent/
      AnotherComponent.tsx
      AnotherComponent.module.scss
      index.ts
    index.ts                     # Re-exports all sub-components
```

## Client vs Server

- Add `"use client"` only when the component uses hooks, event handlers, or browser APIs
- Connectors that fetch Contentful data are server components (no `"use client"`)
- Page components in `app/[lang]/` are server components by default

## Props & Types

- Define props as `type` (not `interface`) unless extending
- Colocate types with the component, or in a shared `types/` file if reused
- Use `Record<string, unknown>` instead of `any` where possible

## Hooks

- `useWindowSize()` — returns `{ windowSize, isMobile, isDesktop }` (breakpoint: 800px)
- `useAuth()` — returns `{ isAuthenticated, isLoading, user, signOut }`
- `useNavigationContext()` — returns `{ isOpen, toggle, ref, setRef, fixed, sticky, stuck }`

## i18n

- Use `useTranslations("Namespace")` for scoped translations
- Namespace matches JSON key: `"Search"`, `"Navigation"`, `"Gallery"`, `"Calendar"`
- Root-level keys accessed with `useTranslations()` (no namespace): `"filters"`, `"quickFilters"`, `"map"`
- Always update all three locale files: `messages/en.json`, `messages/fr.json`, `messages/es.json`

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

- Don't put `isOpen` in useEffect dependency arrays that close menus (creates open→close loops)
- Don't use `em` for icon sizes (parent-dependent) — use `rem` or px numbers
- Don't conditionally render based on `typeof window` (causes hydration mismatches)
- Don't use `useId()` for elements that render in both server and client (use stable string IDs)
